1
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:45,510
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:46,830
[Episode 34]

3
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:47,340
[Adapted from Migu's novel
“Unsoiled Starlight” ]

4
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Author: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:52,960
In recent years, Ruixin has used
cooperation as an excuse

6
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:55,600
to plagiarize the source code
of many independent developers.

7
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,880
Most of the victims who sued

8
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:57,880
lost their cases.

9
00:01:07,250 --> 00:01:08,120
Hi, Xu Wei.

10
00:01:10,990 --> 00:01:11,880
I need your help.

11
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:13,770
Could you contact the other victims

12
00:01:13,770 --> 00:01:16,230
to help file a joint lawsuit
against Ruixin?

13
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:19,720
Oh, the technical agreement?

14
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:21,120
I'll check it right away.

15
00:01:29,670 --> 00:01:31,270
Modify the technical deliverables

16
00:01:31,270 --> 00:01:34,120
to achieve
financial data presentation results

17
00:01:35,420 --> 00:01:37,820
that align with Party A's strategic needs?

18
00:01:44,210 --> 00:01:47,070
[Tingjing Finance of Hengsheng Capital
withdrew investment]

19
00:01:46,479 --> 00:01:47,880
Hengsheng Capital?

20
00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,600
Tingjing Finance?

21
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:53,720
Tingjing Finance withdrew investment?

22
00:02:07,290 --> 00:02:08,220
[Tinglan]

23
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:15,410
Hello, Tinglan.

24
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:17,800
Are you setting up Ruixin?

25
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:21,280
Using Hengsheng Capital's investment
as a front,

26
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:22,360
you used Tingjing Finance

27
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,079
to create an illusion
of fierce competition,

28
00:02:24,079 --> 00:02:26,829
forcing Wen Jian
to expose the fact of valuation fraud.

29
00:02:26,829 --> 00:02:28,040
The intellectual property case

30
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,640
isn't the point at all, is it?

31
00:02:31,620 --> 00:02:33,880
It's just normal business competition.

32
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:37,040
Competition is one thing.

33
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:37,700
Zhuo Yu'an,

34
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:38,920
I'm warning you,

35
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,740
don't cross the red line of policy.

36
00:02:40,740 --> 00:02:42,000
If anything happens,

37
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:44,290
Zhuoyuan Technology can't afford it.

38
00:02:44,829 --> 00:02:45,760
Tinglan,

39
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,800
from the way you're talking,

40
00:02:49,370 --> 00:02:50,240
it sounds like you're more than

41
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:52,570
just concerned about a business partner.

42
00:02:52,970 --> 00:02:54,640
I'm talking to you seriously.

43
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,200
Exactly.

44
00:02:58,720 --> 00:03:00,320
The software copyright infringement

45
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:01,400
was just Ruixin's first step

46
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,400
in creating an inflated valuation.

47
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,440
Next,

48
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,570
they used the plagiarized code

49
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:08,780
to create market-leading technology

50
00:03:09,050 --> 00:03:11,320
and fabricated huge orders with it.

51
00:03:14,410 --> 00:03:15,930
and fabricated huge orders with it.

52
00:03:15,770 --> 00:03:21,240
[Judge] [Presiding Judge]
[People's Assessor]

53
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,840
However, the purchase contract

54
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,680
with Xinke Industrial was fraudulent.

55
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,880
Forensic examination confirmed

56
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:22,280
that the company's seal
did not match the one on file.

57
00:03:21,270 --> 00:03:24,130
[Agent] [Plaintiff]

58
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,760
It was, in fact, a shell company.

59
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,640
These orders generated no real revenue,

60
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:28,510
yet they were included
in the fundraising materials

61
00:03:28,510 --> 00:03:30,760
presented to Hengsheng Capital,

62
00:03:30,970 --> 00:03:33,079
causing us
to suffer significant financial harm.

63
00:03:33,079 --> 00:03:33,600
Accordingly,

64
00:03:33,329 --> 00:03:35,220
[Judge] [Presiding Judge]
[People's Assessor]

65
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:35,400
we sue the defendant company for

66
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,600
copyright infringement,

67
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:38,930
economic fraud, and unfair competition.

68
00:03:39,090 --> 00:03:39,880
Your Honor,

69
00:03:40,079 --> 00:03:41,560
I object to this surprise evidence.

70
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,840
The procedure is seriously flawed,

71
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,530
and the evidence was obtained unlawfully.

72
00:03:44,530 --> 00:03:48,710
[Judge] [Presiding Judge]
[People's Assessor]

73
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,040
Regarding the defendant's objection

74
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:49,040
about the legality
of the evidence's source,

75
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:51,500
you must provide a reasonable explanation.

76
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,440
Your Honor,

77
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:56,430
these materials were compiled by our side:

78
00:03:56,430 --> 00:03:58,000
[Case File] [Court Record]
[Evidence List]

79
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,360
internal investigation,

80
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,280
compliance statement

81
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:01,880
and a declaration confirming
the lawful source of the evidence.

82
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:03,960
Your Honor,

83
00:04:04,010 --> 00:04:06,040
given that Ruixin's misconduct

84
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,200
was not an isolated incident,

85
00:04:07,050 --> 00:04:10,270
[Judge] [Presiding Judge]
[People's Assessor]

86
00:04:07,220 --> 00:04:08,440
we have joined forces

87
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:10,800
we have joined forces

88
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,160
with seven other affected parties.

89
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:13,680
After this case is concluded,

90
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,080
with Zhuoyuan Technology
as the lead plaintiff,

91
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:18,010
we will pursue further legal action
against Ruixin.

92
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:38,800
Mr. Wu.

93
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:41,080
I've already talked to Mr. Zhuo,

94
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:41,800
hoping he would be lenient

95
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,560
for the sake of the company.

96
00:04:44,159 --> 00:04:45,120
But he said

97
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:47,480
he would fight Ruixin to the end.

98
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:49,480
In that case,

99
00:04:49,570 --> 00:04:50,480
Ms. Wen.

100
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:52,760
I'm only conveying
the chairman's decision.

101
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:54,690
The company will take legal action

102
00:04:54,830 --> 00:04:56,240
against you personally

103
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,960
for financial crimes.

104
00:04:58,490 --> 00:04:59,560
Mr. Wu,

105
00:05:02,250 --> 00:05:04,250
can I talk to the chairman in person?

106
00:05:21,710 --> 00:05:25,530
[Senzhou City People's Court]

107
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:23,240
Pleasure working with you, Ms. Shu.

108
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,770
Pleasure working with you.

109
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:27,530
Let's have a celebration dinner tonight.

110
00:05:29,190 --> 00:05:29,800
I'll pass.

111
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:31,360
I still have work to do when I get back.

112
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,159
It's not a complete victory yet.

113
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:35,290
Don't celebrate before it's over.

114
00:05:36,070 --> 00:05:37,930
It's not really a victory dinner.

115
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:40,320
I've invited Mr. Xiao and the others too.

116
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:41,960
Think of it as Zhuoyuan Tech's way

117
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:42,750
of thanking our

118
00:05:42,750 --> 00:05:44,210
long-standing partners.

119
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:46,880
I know

120
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,040
you won't turn Mr. Xiao down.

121
00:05:51,230 --> 00:05:52,680
It's settled then.

122
00:05:59,170 --> 00:06:00,160
This guy

123
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,560
always has a million reasons

124
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,620
you can't say no to.

125
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:08,680
Congratulations,

126
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,600
Ms. Shu.

127
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,600
Cheers.

128
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:20,420
Your drinking has really improved.

129
00:06:20,420 --> 00:06:21,950
Having a good time tonight?

130
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:25,130
Tinglan, you've really
grown into your own.

131
00:06:25,130 --> 00:06:26,600
You used to be the little tagalong

132
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:28,320
always following Mr. Zhou and me around.

133
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:30,230
Now you can hold your own.

134
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,650
People always have to improve.

135
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,880
It's been so many years.

136
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:37,320
How come Mr. Zhou's tolerance for alcohol

137
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:38,520
has gotten worse?

138
00:06:39,909 --> 00:06:41,360
You were the worst drinker

139
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,840
at the firm.

140
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:44,150
And now you're making fun of me?

141
00:06:44,150 --> 00:06:44,920
Not at all.

142
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:45,900
Junhua,

143
00:06:45,950 --> 00:06:47,000
is that true?

144
00:06:47,400 --> 00:06:48,730
You were second to last.

145
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,560
So don't make fun of him.

146
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,680
Your very first case

147
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,880
was recommended by Mr. Zhou, after all.

148
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,040
Okay, okay.

149
00:06:56,060 --> 00:06:57,040
Then I'll toast you.

150
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,640
-Thank you, Mr. Zhou.
- Well.

151
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:01,290
I'll drink tea instead of wine.

152
00:07:01,740 --> 00:07:03,000
Thank you all

153
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:04,720
for your dedication

154
00:07:04,950 --> 00:07:06,350
to Zhuoyuan Technology.

155
00:07:07,670 --> 00:07:08,760
Cheers.

156
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,550
Did you park your car over there?

157
00:07:24,550 --> 00:07:25,600
Yes.

158
00:07:34,380 --> 00:07:35,720
What about Tinglan?

159
00:07:36,950 --> 00:07:38,610
It's fine. I'll take her home.

160
00:07:41,650 --> 00:07:42,440
Mr. Zhuo.

161
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,560
Cherish the present.

162
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,600
Are you drunk?

163
00:08:04,020 --> 00:08:05,560
Let's go.

164
00:08:06,130 --> 00:08:07,200
Where to?

165
00:08:11,170 --> 00:08:13,640
Aren't you taking me home?

166
00:08:18,090 --> 00:08:19,720
Let's go.

167
00:08:29,410 --> 00:08:31,140
Why aren't you holding my hand?

168
00:08:49,540 --> 00:08:51,240
You're indeed drunk.

169
00:09:46,550 --> 00:09:47,640
Shu Tinglan.

170
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,680
Tinglan.

171
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:51,600
We're here.

172
00:10:27,570 --> 00:10:28,640
I can't walk.

173
00:10:28,660 --> 00:10:29,280
Carry me.

174
00:10:39,610 --> 00:10:43,260
♪ I'll wait for you in the crowd ♪

175
00:10:44,340 --> 00:10:50,090
We're in sync. Unbelievable.

176
00:10:51,250 --> 00:10:55,780
♪ It's the cloak of a close embrace ♪

177
00:10:56,460 --> 00:11:01,790
♪ It's the steadfast days and
nights we share ♪

178
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:08,020
♪ When we weather the storm together,
don't forget ♪

179
00:11:08,890 --> 00:11:13,300
♪ Breathing in the long river of time ♪

180
00:11:13,330 --> 00:11:14,320
Zhuo Yu'an.

181
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:19,510
♪ My only promise is to you ♪

182
00:11:15,140 --> 00:11:16,840
I miss you so much

183
00:11:21,620 --> 00:11:24,340
♪ Between us ♪

184
00:11:22,390 --> 00:11:24,000
I miss you too.

185
00:11:24,630 --> 00:11:27,490
♪ Suspicion feels so far away ♪

186
00:11:27,980 --> 00:11:33,440
♪ When our eyes meet,
I feel your burning gaze ♪

187
00:11:33,890 --> 00:11:36,800
♪ The wind by the shore has stilled ♪

188
00:11:37,070 --> 00:11:39,670
♪ And you're smiling too ♪

189
00:11:40,170 --> 00:11:42,500
♪ Make a wish to the wind ♪

190
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:48,160
♪ It's Cupid's arrow,
set loose from the string ♪

191
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:48,520
Xiao He?

192
00:11:58,690 --> 00:12:02,390
♪ I'll wait for you in the crowd ♪

193
00:12:03,410 --> 00:12:08,630
♪ Hearts in sync—how incredible ♪

194
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,500
Drink some honey water when you wake up

195
00:12:08,500 --> 00:12:10,160
and you won't have a headache.

196
00:12:10,350 --> 00:12:15,140
♪ It's the familiar breath we share ♪

197
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,640
Zhuo Yu'an.

198
00:12:15,390 --> 00:12:20,690
♪ It's being each other's exception ♪

199
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:17,200
I miss you so much.

200
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,840
I miss you too.

201
00:12:21,990 --> 00:12:23,440
Zhuo Yu'an?

202
00:12:22,010 --> 00:12:27,290
♪ When tides ebb and flow, I look to you ♪

203
00:12:27,850 --> 00:12:32,620
♪ Drowning in the long river of time ♪

204
00:12:33,050 --> 00:12:37,080
♪ You're the only air I breathe ♪
